WEBVTT

00:13:29.638 --> 00:13:35.269
just imagine the impact
that you will have on their life,

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:38.272
their families, the community

00:13:38.313 --> 00:13:39.773
and your organization.

00:13:40.732 --> 00:13:41.984
Thank you.

00:13:42.025 --> 00:13:45.487
(Cheers and applause)